{"unit_id":"yinvoke__dsh-plugin-session-delete#card-zh","repo":"yinvoke/dsh-plugin-session-delete","commit":"b73ed3e964e68a944c934db5ada2ed0a41b131f3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-plugin-session-delete 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的会话管理插件，在会话行菜单加入删除入口，并由宿主提供配套的删除与恢复路由。用户选择会话、勾选确认后，插件会暂存该会话日志并从工作区列表移除；右下角提示可在五秒窗口内恢复日志及工作区关联状态，期限结束后宿主清理暂存目录。插件还处理操作状态查询、重试、重启后的恢复，以及存在活动任务时拒绝删除。适合希望从 Web 会话列表清理单个旧会话、同时需要短暂撤销机会的 DSH 用户。安装后需要重启 DSH；可通过 DSH_HOME 指定数据目录，不需要额外 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:237-317","lib/index.js:319-341","lib/client.js:171-197","lib/client.js:231-260"]}
{"unit_id":"yinvoke__dsh-plugin-session-delete#card-en","repo":"yinvoke/dsh-plugin-session-delete","commit":"b73ed3e964e68a944c934db5ada2ed0a41b131f3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-plugin-session-delete adds a delete action to DSH Web session rows. After confirmation, the host stages the log and removes workspace links. Restore within five seconds; then staged data is cleaned up. Recovery resumes after restart. DSH_HOME is optional; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:237-317","lib/index.js:319-341","lib/client.js:171-197","lib/client.js:231-260"]}
